1. An endoscope image processing system comprising:  

an image acquisition interface configured to receive a color endoscopic image including a plurality of pixels, each pixel having a plurality of color component values; and  

one or more processors configured to:  

extract, for each of at least a subset of the plurality of pixels, first and second color component values from the plurality of color component values;  

plot each of the at least the subset of pixels as a corresponding point on a two-axis color plane defined by a first axis representing the first color component value and a second axis representing the second color component value;  

define, in the two-axis color plane, a third axis different from the first axis and the second axis, the third axis corresponding to a reference color direction associated with a predetermined tissue condition;  

calculate, for each corresponding point or for a distribution of the corresponding points, a distance from the third axis; and  

evaluate the color endoscopic image based at least in part on the calculated distance, thereby generating evaluation information indicative of a condition of tissue represented in the color endoscopic image.

1. An endoscope system comprising:

image acquisition means configured to acquire an endoscopic image of an object to be observed;

pixel placement means configured to place, in a color-component plane defined by a first axis corresponding to a first color component and a second axis corresponding to a second color component, pixels of the endoscopic image based on color-component values of the pixels;

distance data calculation means configured to calculate distance data for each of the placed pixels, the distance data representing a distance in a direction of a third axis from a predetermined reference, the third axis being different from the first axis and the second axis and corresponding to a third color component; and

evaluation value calculation means configured to calculate an evaluation value of the endoscopic image based on the distance data calculated by the distance data calculation means.
